      "side": 1,
      "message": "If everything is piped through correctly, this should cause `cc_is_snk_dbg_acc` to return `true`. The coverage report suggests that that\u0027s not happening.\n\nIt looks like you don\u0027t have a test case here for debug accessory/no DTS port/DRP toggle staying in AttachWait.SRC, which was the new behavior added in this CL. In addition to verifying the intended behavior, such a test case is probably also the easiest way to make sure these tests are working as intended. All of the tests you have so far should get the same result without this CL. It will be easier to check that the coverage results make sense with this additional positive behavior test.",
